fn f ['heap](heap: &uniq Heap<'heap>, x: own i32) -> function_result: own i32 pure, allocates(heap) {
  doc "D7 raw fn_sig parameters admit comma after pure in FOLLOW(effects); in this unchanged top-level source the comma fails the enclosing fn_decl continuation under DIAG-1/GRAM-2. The program still rejects and pure still cannot combine with another category.";
